1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,620
Have you ever tried breathing and

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,560
swallowing at the exact same time?

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,440
It's physically impossible!

4
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,700
That's because your throat has a

5
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,420
built-in traffic controller called the epiglottis.

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,040
Every time you swallow,

7
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:14,300
this tiny flap of tissue flips

8
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:15,800
down to cover your windpipe,

9
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:18,100
locking the airway so food and

10
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,740
liquid go straight to your stomach

11
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:20,880
instead of your lungs.

12
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,860
Your body literally pauses your breathing

13
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:25,700
for a split second to save

14
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,420
you from choking!

15
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:27,520
So,

16
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,720
why putting your face in ice

17
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:31,860
water for 10 seconds calms down?

18
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:33,380
Want to know the answer?

19
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,000
Watch our next video,

20
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:36,660
and don't forget to follow us

21
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,760
for more amazing facts about your

22
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,060
body.
